1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:05,309
Every day at five,
the cat came to the window.

2
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:09,439
And every day,
the old man left a little bowl out.

3
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:14,857
Spring. Summer. Autumn.
They never said a word.

4
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:21,498
They didn't need to.

5
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:27,691
Then one winter,
the window stayed dark.

6
00:00:29,450 --> 00:00:32,290
The cat came anyway.

7
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:37,638
One evening,
the light came back on.

8
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:43,769
This time,
she opened the window all the way.
